[  173.2s] NOTE assumption: The memo (19 Oct 2026, effective 2 Nov 2026) overrides policy v3.2 wherever they differ, as both the memo and Morag's email say. The memo also overrides the old dialler code list.
[  173.2s] NOTE assumption: Memo A: the early band is now 1-14 days and the mid band 15-30 days. The late band (31-60) is unchanged. Each band keeps its deadline and number of attempts (early 1, mid 2, late 3).
[  173.2s] NOTE assumption: Memo B: Friday 11 Dec 2026 is a non-business day and is added to the holidays. It is skipped when counting business days, and no promise or callback may fall on it.
[  173.2s] NOTE assumption: Rule 11: 24 Dec 2026 is a normal business day, so it is not in the holidays list.
[  173.2s] NOTE assumption: Memo C: the reason code 'refused' is retired. 'declined' is used as both the close_call reason and the add_note reason, and the tool API enums agree.
